    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:b9ad3e14216c2f08",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "2317df282c4016a744e49286d6f59fb49523c82919517f710bb3c1016b16a293",
      "text": "Breakfast at the hotel.\n\nTransfer to Uyuni airport for flight to La Paz (flight not included).\n\nArrival in La Paz and transfer to the hotel.\n\nIn the afternoon, half-day City Tour and Moon Valley. Visit of Killi Killi viewpoint for panoramic views of the city. Visit of Plaza Murillo, Presidential Palace, Legislative Palace and Metropolitan Cathedral. Continuation to the Valley of the Moon to observe its unique geological formations. Ride on the Yellow Line cable car for aerial views of La Paz and Illimani Mountain. Visit of the Witches’ Market and handicraft markets.\n\nAccommodation at hotel in La Paz & Overnight. ",
      "provenance": {
